---
// 隐私政策页：/privacy/（符合 GDPR、马来西亚 PDPA、印尼 PDP、拉美隐私法规）
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Our privacy policy — how we collect and use data, in line with GDPR, PDPA, and related regulations.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Effective 2026-10-08</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">1. What we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect email addresses you provide for newsletter or membership subscriptions, and basic analytics (pages viewed). We do not collect payment card details; payments are handled by Stripe and PayPal.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">2. How we use it</h2>
  <p>Email addresses are used to deliver newsletters and manage membership access. Analytics are used to improve content. We do not sell personal data.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">3. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use minimal cookies for session and analytics. You can disable cookies in your browser.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size:20px;">4. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under GDPR and applicable local laws (e.g., Malaysia PDPA), you may request access, correction, or deletion of your data. Contact us via the subscribe page.</p>
</BaseLayout>
